\tag{fdip}
\title{Gauge fields, charges and sampling in lattice chirality}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{Which symmetries preserve or reverse the overlap index of the
[Wilson kernel](fdip-0153)? Which connections force this index to vanish,
and what do finite flux examples show?}

\p{The Wilson operator has #{c_W=a/2} on a periodic grid. Its Hermitian Clifford
module carries a spin grading, its nonzero finite-dimensional internal fiber
carries the unitary links, and the index is defined for regular connections.}
\transclude{fdip-0151}
